{"name":"Mouth widening appliance","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":20,"casual":{"lead":["A mouth widening appliance is a rigid or semi-rigid device placed inside the mouth that presses outward on the corners of the lips. Users hope that repeated gentle stretching increases mouth width so the smile looks wider and the lower face better proportioned.","The idea borrows from medical devices used for microstomia, a condition of abnormally small mouth opening. Within looksmaxxing forums, people share 3D-printable designs in widths from 7 to 12 cm, DIY versions and commercial microstomia appliances, and post before-and-after pictures."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["Forum threads describe printing a model in a chosen width through a 3D printing service or buying a clinical appliance sold for microstomia prevention, then wearing it inside the mouth at intervals. Members discuss which width to choose and report results in threads. Timelines vary by account."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["No published study has tested these appliances for widening a healthy mouth. In clinical use, microstomia appliances and exercises are directed by a healthcare professional. Forum members raise questions about downsides, such as smile lines and philtrum changes, in dedicated threads."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[{"title":"Early diagnosis of progressive systemic sclerosis (scleroderma) from a panoramic view: report of three cases.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21960405/","source":"Dento maxillo facial radiology","year":2011,"cites":27,"kind":null},{"title":"Long-term griseofulvin treatment for progressive systemic sclerosis.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/3823792/","source":"Scandinavian journal of rheumatology","year":1986,"cites":8,"kind":null},{"title":"What do Sopranos and Singing Teachers Think About Upper High Range Notes?","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33032886/","source":"Journal of voice : official journal of the Voice Foundation","year":2022,"cites":0,"kind":null}],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Mouth widening for better philtrum?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mouth-widening-for-better-philtrum.527246/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220714015217/https://looksmax.org/threads/mouth-widening-for-better-philtrum.527246/"},{"title":"Guide Mouth Widening Appliances","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mouth-widening-appliances.133623/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210720023332/https://looksmax.org/threads/mouth-widening-appliances.133623/"},{"title":"Discussion Mouth Widening Device","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mouth-widening-device.41234/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210901062511/https://looksmax.org/threads/mouth-widening-device.41234/"},{"title":"mouth widening guide","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mouth-widening-guide.36182/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210729145610/https://looksmax.org/threads/mouth-widening-guide.36182/"},{"title":"the ultimate natural mouth widening guide","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/the-ultimate-natural-mouth-widening-guide.1412972/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250426062723/https://looksmax.org/threads/the-ultimate-natural-mouth-widening-guide.1412972/"},{"title":"my new mouth widening invention without smile lines","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/my-new-mouth-widening-invention-without-smile-lines.1150984/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240926133900/https://looksmax.org/threads/my-new-mouth-widening-invention-without-smile-lines.1150984/"},{"title":"theoretical permanent lip mouth widening results w o surgery","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/theoretical-permanent-lip-mouth-widening-results-w-o-surgery.927983/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/w